OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fto start. Rain slowly moving
OL,7,Fsouthwards during the day to become
OL,8,Fconfined to Fife and Central. Further
OL,9,Fnorth turning drier and brighter from
OL,10,Fthe north in the afternoon. Cold.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain over Fife and Central to
OL,13,Fstart will clear to the south. Dry
OL,14,Fwith clear spells further north. Then
OL,15,Fdry overnight with clear spells
OL,16,Fleading to a cold, frosty night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
