OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA mostly dry day with patchy
OL,6,Fcloud and long sunny spells after a
OL,7,Ffrosty start. Perhaps cloudier in the
OL,8,Fnorth later with the odd shower
OL,9,Fpossible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry with sunny spells Friday, the odd
OL,13,Fshower in the north possible. Dry with
OL,14,Fsome long sunny spells Saturday.
OL,15,FCloudier with a few showers Sunday.
OL,16,FCold with frosty nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
